8 items

█████████ 8/8 matched

Best complete basket

[Blinkit logo]
₹524

Save ₹77

8/8 available
12–18 min
```

Then alternative providers.

The signature animation could show basket items softly snapping into the winning provider lane after optimization—not 30 objects flying around simultaneously.

