Food should be one of the most image-rich categories.

Zomato’s own current consumer positioning emphasizes restaurant discovery, collections, offers, dietary modes and app-first ordering; those cues reinforce how visually driven food discovery is. citeturn18search2

TrueCost should use:

- legitimate dish imagery,
- restaurant imagery,
- restaurant/branch identity,
- strong delivery-time typography,
- delivered-total pricing,
- warm category accents.

But it must not become a food-discovery clone.

TrueCost’s unique screen is:

