### Pharmacy

Pharmacy should deliberately **not** share Food or Shopping’s visual excitement.

It should feel:

```text
white
quiet
clinical
precise
safe
high contrast
```

The identity-critical part should be impossible to miss:

```text
Dolo 650
Paracetamol 650 mg
Tablet
15 tablets
Micro Labs
```

Strength and form should live directly beneath the product name rather than inside an expandable specs view.

The difference between:

```text
