```

needs more visual priority than a ₹5 saving.

Use product packaging imagery where evidence provides it, but avoid decorative medical imagery.

No confetti.

No bouncing medicine boxes.

No “🎉 Cheapest medicine!”

Trust must beat entertainment.

### Shopping

Shopping can become TrueCost’s most editorial category.

Apple’s 2025 Design Awards specifically praised Taobao’s polished product interactions and useful side-by-side comparison capability. citeturn12search0

