Changing the variant should smoothly transform the comparison rather than reload the entire page abruptly.

### Mobility

Mobility should be **map-first and context-first** rather than card-first.

Uber’s current product still centers the flow on pickup, destination, the map, ride options and upfront estimates before confirmation; Uber explicitly positions those estimates as a way to compare costs before choosing a ride. citeturn18search0turn18search1

TrueCost can make this even more useful:

```text
